{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39200","headline":"谒蒋帝庙 · 韦庄","name":"谒蒋帝庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"建业城边蒋帝祠，素髯清骨旧风姿。\n江声似激秦军破，山势如匡晋祚危。\n残雪岭头明组练，晚霞檐外簇旌旗。\n金陵客路方流落，空祝回銮奠酒巵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39200.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39200","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}